  "hindi": "हे वाजो, हे ऋभुक्षाओ, हे देवो, देवों के चलने योग्य मार्गों से हमारे यज्ञ के पास आओ, जिससे तुम आनन्दित होकर इन प्रजाओं में दिनों के उत्तम दिनों पर मनु के यज्ञ को ग्रहण करो।",
  "english": "Come to our rite, Vājas, Ṛbhukṣans, gods, by the paths travelled by gods, so that you, delighting, may take up Manu's sacrifice among these peoples on fair days of the days.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "ṛbhukṣāḥ: the printed form is a plural vocative/nominative of the name; the stem form is uncertain (ṛbhukṣan- would give ṛbhukṣaṇaḥ). manuṣaḥ taken as genitive of manus (Manu); an ablative reading is not likely here. sudineṣv ahnām: literally 'on fair days among the days'. The sandhi 'vikṣvā3su' carries a pluta mark (not a typo).",
  "confidence": "medium"
